config BC_QEMU_REPL
	bool "Start the interactive REPL on QEMU"
	help
	  On qemu_riscv32 the application normally runs the self-tests and then
	  exits QEMU through the SiFive test device, which CI relies on. With this
	  option it runs the self-tests and then starts the interactive REPL on the
	  serial console, as it does on hardware.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
